## Introduction

The Cleveleys Car Show 2025 is set to be a marquee automotive event, scheduled for 8th June 2025, from 10 AM to 4 PM. This annual gathering is renowned for transforming the town centre and promenade of Cleveleys, Lancashire, into a vibrant celebration of automotive culture. Sponsored by Crystal Clear Details, the event promises to be a spectacular showcase of classic and modern vehicles, attracting enthusiasts from across the region and beyond.

## Event Details

<a href="https://classiccarclubs.uk/club-events/cleveleys-classic-vehicle-show-2025/">The Cleveleys Car Show ,</a> will take place along Victoria Road West and the picturesque seaside promenade, offering a unique backdrop for the display of hundreds of vehicles. This free event is designed to be a family-friendly affair, providing an exciting day out for attendees of all ages. The show will feature a diverse array of cars, from classic models to the latest high-performance vehicles, ensuring there is something to captivate every automotive enthusiast.

## Logistics and Planning

### Venue and Accessibility

The event will be held at the town centre and promenade in Cleveleys, Lancashire. The location is easily accessible via public transport and provides ample parking for visitors arriving by car. The strategic positioning along the coast not only enhances the visual appeal of the event but also supports local businesses by drawing visitors to nearby shops, cafés, and restaurants.

### Registration and Costs

Vehicle registration for exhibitors is conducted in advance, with a fee of £12 per vehicle. For those preferring to register on the day, tickets will be available at the gate for £15 per vehicle. This structured registration process ensures a seamless experience for both exhibitors and attendees.

## Marketing Strategies

The Cleveleys Car Show utilises a multi-platform marketing strategy to maximise reach and engagement. The event is promoted through various channels, including the official event website, social media platforms such as Facebook and Instagram, and local tourism websites like Visit Fylde Coast. These efforts are complemented by partnerships with local businesses and sponsors, such as Crystal Clear Details, which help to enhance the event's visibility and appeal.

## Potential Exhibitors and Attractions

The show is expected to feature a wide range of exhibitors, showcasing vehicles from different eras and categories. Notable marques such as McLaren, Ferrari, and Porsche are anticipated to participate, highlighting the evolution of automotive technology, particularly in the realm of hybrid and high-performance cars. In addition to individual exhibitors, car clubs are encouraged to register and display their collections, fostering a sense of community among enthusiasts.

## Economic and Community Impact

The Cleveleys Car Show plays a significant role in boosting the local economy by attracting visitors to the area. The influx of attendees provides a substantial economic boost to local businesses, including hospitality, retail, and service sectors. Furthermore, the event fosters community spirit by bringing together residents and visitors in a shared celebration of automotive culture. The show's emphasis on inclusivity and accessibility ensures that it remains a beloved annual tradition for the Cleveleys community.

## Conclusion

The Cleveleys Car Show 2025 is poised to be a highlight of the automotive calendar, offering a dynamic blend of classic and contemporary vehicles set against the stunning backdrop of the Cleveleys coastline. With its comprehensive planning, robust marketing strategies, and diverse range of exhibitors, the event promises to deliver an unforgettable experience for car enthusiasts and casual visitors alike. As the date approaches, anticipation continues to build for what is sure to be a spectacular day celebrating the world of automobiles.

